          "unit": "x",
          "direction": "min",
          "maintenance": true,
          "text": "The Borrower and the Subsidiaries will not permit the Fixed Charge Coverage Ratio, as of the last day of any Fiscal Quarter for the four consecutive Fiscal Quarters ending on that date, to be less than 1.15 to 1.00. 1.31.2 Total Cash Flow Leverage Ratio ."
